---
import '../styles/global.css';
const features = [
  ['01', 'A shop that’s yours', 'Give your business a dedicated webshop with its own identity. Connect a domain you already own, or let us arrange one.'],
  ['02', 'You’re in control', 'Manage your products and orders from your own admin panel. Keep the day-to-day running of your shop in your hands.'],
  ['03', 'We keep it running', 'Hosting and support are included in your subscription. You have a team to turn to as you build your online business.'],
];
const faqs = [
  ['What is included in my subscription?', 'Your subscription includes a dedicated webshop powered by Wrenio Commerce, hosting, support, and your own admin panel to manage products and orders. Domain registration is separate.'],
  ['How much does a domain cost?', 'Domain registration costs PKR 4,200 for two years. ICTmates can arrange registration, or you can buy directly from a PKNIC reseller. Contact us to check your preferred domain’s availability.'],
  ['Can I use a domain I already own?', 'Yes. You can bring your existing domain for your dedicated webshop. We’ll discuss the connection details when setting up your shop.'],
  ['Do you charge a commission on my sales?', 'The dedicated webshop offer uses a monthly or annual subscription, with no marketplace sales commission. Selling on the action.pk marketplace is a separate option with a 20% sales commission. Payment-provider, delivery, and other third-party charges are separate from marketplace commission; ask us about your setup.'],
  ['Is this the same as a seller page on action.pk?', 'No. The subscription is for your own dedicated webshop. A seller page on the action.pk marketplace is a separate way to sell. We can help you choose the right option for your business.'],
  ['Can I see Wrenio Commerce before deciding?', 'Yes. Explore the public test storefront at webstore.pk and the A2Z Products seller page, or contact ICTmates for a walkthrough of the dedicated webshop and admin panel. The test storefront is part of the ongoing action.pk migration.'],
  ['Can you help me move from Shopify or WooCommerce?', 'Tell us about your existing store, products, and requirements. We’ll review the migration scope and discuss the work and any additional cost before you decide.'],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Your own webshop from PKR 3,000/month | ICTmates</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Start your own online shop in Pakistan with Wrenio Commerce by ICTmates. Dedicated webshop, hosting and support for PKR 3,000/month or PKR 30,000/year. Domain separate." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://ictmates.com/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1169" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Your business. Your own online shop. | ICTmates" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A ready-made webshop for Pakistan. PKR 3,000/month, including hosting and support. Powered by Wrenio Commerce." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://ictmates.com/" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="announcement">Made for businesses in Pakistan <span>·</span> Pay yearly and get two months free <a href="#pricing">See plans ↗︎</a></div>
    <header class="header wrap">
      <a class="logo" href="#" aria-label="ICTmates home"><img src="/ictmates-logo.png" alt="ICT Mates" width="1000" height="333" /></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#webshops">Webshops</a><a href="/why-wrenio/">Why Wrenio?</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#services">IT services</a><a href="#about">About us</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="button small" href="#contact">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></a>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero wrap" id="webshops">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> WRENIO COMMERCE BY ICTMATES</div>
          <h1>Your business.<br />Your own<br /><em>online shop.</em></h1>
          <p class="intro">Turn your business into an online destination. A ready-made webshop with your own domain, hosting, and a team on your side.</p>
          <div class="hero-price"><strong>PKR 3,000</strong><span>/ month</span></div>
          <p class="price-note">Hosting & support included. Domain sold separately.</p>
          <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#contact">Get my webshop <span aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://webstore.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore test store <span aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></a></div>
          <div class="hero-checks"><span>✓ Your own brand</span><span>✓ Your own admin panel</span><span>✓ No sales commission*</span></div>
          <p class="fine-print">*On your dedicated webshop. Marketplace selling is a separate offer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a dedicated webshop and product management panel">
          <div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div>
          <div class="art-label">A LITTLE IDEA. A WORLD OF POSSIBILITIES.</div>
          <div class="store-window">
            <div class="browser-bar"><span class="browser-dots">● ● ●</span><span class="address">⌑ &nbsp; yourbrand.pk</span><span>↗︎</span></div>
            <div class="store-nav"><strong>everyday<span>®</span></strong><span>Shop &nbsp; About &nbsp; <span aria-hidden="true">▢</span></span></div>
            <div class="store-hero"><span>THOUGHTFULLY CHOSEN.</span><h2>Small things.<br />Everyday joy.</h2><span class="mock-button">Discover the collection ↗︎</span><div class="vase"><i></i></div><div class="sun-circle"></div></div>
            <div class="store-section-title"><strong>Your next favourite</strong><span>Shop all ↗︎</span></div>
            <div class="mock-products"><div><div class="product-art peach"><div class="mug"></div></div><strong>The everyday mug</strong><span>PKR 1,200</span></div><div><div class="product-art sage"><div class="tote"></div></div><strong>The go-anywhere tote</strong><span>PKR 1,800</span></div><div><div class="product-art lavender"><div class="bottle"></div></div><strong>The daily bottle</strong><span>PKR 1,500</span></div></div>
            <div class="powered">Powered by <strong>Wrenio Commerce</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="admin-card"><span class="admin-icon" aria-hidden="true">▦</span><div><strong>Your shop. Your dashboard.</strong><span>Products & orders, in your hands.</span></div><span class="check-circle">✓</span></div>
          <div class="hosting-badge"><span aria-hidden="true">✳︎</span><strong>Hosting<br />included.</strong></div>
          <p class="illustration-note">Illustrative storefront · Your shop, your identity</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="proof-strip">
        <div class="wrap proof-inner">
          <a class="proof-item proof-link" href="https://action.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Built by the team</span><strong>behind action.pk <span aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></strong></a>
          <p class="proof-item"><span>A local team.</span><strong>A platform of our own.</strong></p>
          <a class="proof-item proof-link" href="https://webstore.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Meet the platform</span><strong>Wrenio Commerce <span aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></strong></a>
          <p class="proof-item"><span>Based in</span><strong>Lahore, Pakistan</strong></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="section wrap" id="features">
        <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">LESS SETUP. MORE SELLING.</div><h2>Everything starts<br />with <em>your own shop.</em></h2></div><p>A practical alternative to Shopify and WooCommerce for businesses in Pakistan. Clear pricing in rupees, with hosting and support together.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-grid">{features.map(([number,title,description])=><article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-number">{number} /</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div>
      </section>
      <section class="demo-section wrap" id="demo"><div class="demo-copy"><div class="eyebrow">BUILT FROM REAL RETAIL EXPERIENCE</div><h2>Meet the platform<br />behind your next chapter.</h2><p>We run action.pk, a multi-seller marketplace. Now we’re bringing that experience into Wrenio Commerce, our own e-commerce software built on Vendure Core.</p><p>Explore the WC test storefront and see how sellers present their products. Then talk to us about a dedicated webshop for your brand.</p><a class="button light" href="https://webstore.pk/s/a2z-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore a seller demo ↗︎</a><p class="demo-note">Public test site. The action.pk migration to WC is in progress.</p></div><div class="platform-card"><img class="platform-symbol" src="/wren.png" alt="" width="96" height="67" loading="lazy" /><span class="eyebrow">WRENIO COMMERCE</span><h3>One platform.<br />Room for your business.</h3><ul><li><span>01</span> Dedicated webshops</li><li><span>02</span> Seller product & order management</li><li><span>03</span> Marketplace storefronts</li><li><span>04</span> Your own domain</li></ul></div></section>
      <section class="section wrap" id="pricing"><div class="center-heading"><div class="eyebrow">SMALL PRICE. BIG POSSIBILITIES.</div><h2>A real shop.<br /><em>A straightforward price.</em></h2><p>Choose how you pay. Your dedicated webshop, hosting and support are included in both plans.</p></div><div class="pricing-grid"><article class="plan"><span class="eyebrow">KEEP IT MONTHLY</span><h3>Monthly</h3><div class="plan-price"><span>PKR</span> 3,000 <small>/ month</small></div><p>A simple monthly subscription for your shop.</p><ul><li>Dedicated webshop</li><li>Hosting and support</li><li>Your own product & order admin panel</li><li>No marketplace sales commission</li></ul><a class="button outline" href="#contact" data-plan="monthly">Choose monthly ↗︎</a></article><article class="plan featured"><span class="plan-tag">TWO MONTHS FREE</span><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT A YEAR</span><h3>Annual</h3><div class="plan-price"><span>PKR</span> 30,000 <small>/ year</small></div><p>Equivalent to PKR 2,500/month, billed annually.</p><ul><li>Everything in the monthly plan</li><li>Save PKR 6,000 over 12 monthly payments</li><li>Hosting and support all year</li><li>No marketplace sales commission</li></ul><a class="button" href="#contact" data-plan="annual">Choose annual ↗︎</a></article></div><div class="domain-note"><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><div><strong>Your name on the internet.</strong><p>Domain registration is separate: <strong>PKR 4,200 for two years.</strong> We can arrange it, you can buy through a PKNIC reseller, or bring a domain you already own.</p></div></div><p class="pricing-footnote">Subscription pricing is for your dedicated webshop. Payment-provider, delivery and other third-party services may have separate charges; discuss your requirements with us.</p></section>
      <section class="marketplace wrap"><div><div class="eyebrow">ANOTHER WAY TO SELL</div><h2>Prefer to join a marketplace?</h2><p>Sell alongside other businesses on action.pk with your own seller page. Marketplace sales carry a <strong>20% commission</strong>. This is separate from the dedicated webshop subscription.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://action.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore action.pk ↗︎</a></section>
      <section class="section wrap" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR TECHNOLOGY PARTNER</div><h2>A webshop is just<br /><em>the beginning.</em></h2></div><p>Need something beyond your shop? ICTmates also helps businesses build, design and grow their digital presence.</p></div><div class="services-grid">{[['Web & mobile development','Bring your ideas to the web and mobile.'],['UI / UX design','Make your digital products clearer and easier to use.'],['Digital marketing','Help the right people discover your business.'],['Custom Software Development','Software tailored to your business, workflows, and goals.']].map(([title,copy])=><a class="service" href="#contact"><h3>{title}<span aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></h3><p>{copy}</p></a>)}</div></section>
      <section class="about wrap" id="about"><div class="eyebrow">HELLO. WE’RE ICTMATES.</div><h2>Your next chapter.<br /><em>Our team, by your side.</em></h2><div><p>We’re an IT company based in Lahore, Pakistan. Alongside our development, design and marketing services, we operate action.pk and build Wrenio Commerce.</p><p>Our aim is simple: make having your own online shop a practical next step for your business.</p><span class="location">↗︎ Gulberg III, Lahore · Pakistan</span></div></section>
      <section class="section wrap faq" id="faq"><div><div class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS YOU MIGHT ASK</div><h2>Let’s make<br /><em>it clear.</em></h2><p>Something else on your mind?<br /><a href="#contact" class="text-link">Talk to our team ↗︎</a></p></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section>
      <section class="contact wrap" id="contact"><div><div class="eyebrow">LET’S GET YOUR BUSINESS ONLINE</div><h2>Your shop’s next<br />chapter starts here.</h2><p>Tell us what you sell and what you have in mind. We’ll walk you through Wrenio Commerce and the next steps.</p></div><div class="contact-actions"><a class="button lime" id="contact-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/923005551575" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chat with us on WhatsApp ↗︎</a><a class="contact-number" href="https://wa.me/923005551575" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Chat on WhatsApp at +92 300 555 1575">+92 300 555 1575</a><p id="plan-interest" aria-live="polite">Tell us about your project, ask a question, or discuss any of our services.</p><span>Building 13, Block J, Gulberg III<br />Lahore, Pakistan</span></div></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="wrap footer"><a class="logo" href="#"><img src="/ictmates-logo.png" alt="ICT Mates" width="1000" height="333" loading="lazy" /></a><p>Technology for your next chapter.</p><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="/why-wrenio/">Why Wrenio?</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#faq">FAQs</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} ICTmates. All rights reserved.</span><span>Wrenio Commerce · Built by ICTmates in Pakistan</span></div></footer>
    <script>
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('[data-plan]').forEach(link => {
        link.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const text = document.querySelector('#plan-interest');
          const annual = link.dataset.plan === 'annual';
          const plan = annual ? 'PKR 30,000/year' : 'PKR 3,000/month';
          if (text) text.textContent = `Message us on WhatsApp about the ${plan} plan or any of our services.`;
          const whatsapp = document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#contact-whatsapp');
          if (whatsapp) whatsapp.href = `https://wa.me/923005551575?text=${encodeURIComponent(`Hello ICT Mates, I’m interested in the ${plan} webshop plan.`)}`;
        });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
